T_Project_Project_Tasks_LocalFrames_LocalFrame -[hidden]down-> T_Project_Project_Tasks_MatData
T_Project_Project_Tasks_LocalFrames_MovedFrame --|> T_Project_Project_Tasks_LocalFrames_LocalFrame
T_Project_Project_Tasks_LocalFrames_MovedFrameBuilder --> T_Project_Project_Tasks_LocalFrames_MovedFrame : использует
